The crash is caused by bug 912586 which was fixed in 0.0.7E6F1.

The way that glyphs are drawn for explosions changed recently
(can't remember which version, sorry). Whereas previously multiple
grenades exploding would cause a series of small explosions which
would each have their own animation we now calculate an area that
is affected by the explosion (factors include the number and type
of explosive device and their locations). Since this area may not
be square, the glyphs drawn can seem a little strange at first,
especially in text-mode.

